Subject: [PATCH 2613/3799] soh: rename func_80ACBF50 -> EnOwl_TurnThenFly

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: turns onto the stored heading and then switches to the flight
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c
index b7ff36e97..889d1dac5 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c
@@ -942,7 +942,8 @@ void EnOwl_Perched(EnOwl* this, PlayState* PlayState) {
     this->actionFlags |= 8;
 }
 
-void func_80ACBF50(EnOwl* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80ACBF50: turns onto the stored heading and then switches to the flight
+void EnOwl_TurnThenFly(EnOwl* this, PlayState* play) {
     Math_SmoothStepToS(&this->actor.world.rot.y, this->unk_400, 2, 0x384, 0x258);
     this->actor.shape.rot.y = this->actor.world.rot.y;
 
@@ -1005,7 +1006,7 @@ void func_80ACC00C(EnOwl* this, PlayState* play) {
             this->skelAnime.curFrame = 21.0f;
             this->unk_3FE--;
         } else {
-            this->actionFunc = func_80ACBF50;
+            this->actionFunc = EnOwl_TurnThenFly;  // was func_80ACBF50 [LLM:HIGH]
         }
     }
 
